---
import ComingSoon from '../layouts/ComingSoon.astro';
---

<ComingSoon title="Pricing" description="Sentrik pricing — free tier available, paid tiers for advanced governance. Early access available on request.">

<section class="pricing-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <h1>Simple, transparent pricing</h1>
    <p class="pricing-sub">Start free. Upgrade when you need more frameworks or governance features. Early access &mdash; <a href="/#get-free">request access</a> and we&rsquo;ll be in touch.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tiers">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="tier-grid">

      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-header">
          <h3>Free</h3>
          <div class="tier-price"><span class="price-amount">$0</span><span class="price-period">/mo</span><span class="price-seat">per seat</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">Everything you need to start governing AI-generated code &mdash; free forever.</p>
        <ul class="tier-features">
          <li>5 standards packs (158 rules)</li>
          <li>OWASP Top 10, SOC 2, Python Security, Go Security, Supply Chain</li>
          <li>CLI scanning &amp; gate</li>
          <li>Management dashboard</li>
          <li>VS Code &amp; Cursor extension</li>
          <li>MCP server for Claude Code, Cursor, Cline</li>
          <li>GitHub Action</li>
          <li>SBOM, CVE scanning, secrets detection</li>
          <li>Risk scoring on findings</li>
          <li>Community support (GitHub Discussions)</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="/#get-free" class="btn btn-outline tier-cta">Request Free Access</a>
      </div>

      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-header">
          <h3>Team</h3>
          <div class="tier-price"><span class="price-amount">$29</span><span class="price-period">/mo</span><span class="price-seat">per seat</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">Advanced compliance for growing teams with regulatory obligations.</p>
        <ul class="tier-features">
          <li>Everything in Free, plus:</li>
          <li>16 standards packs (368+ rules)</li>
          <li>HIPAA, PCI-DSS, ISO 27001, GDPR</li>
          <li>FDA / IEC 62304, NIST 800-53, CMMC, EU AI Act</li>
          <li>Work item reconciliation (GitHub, Azure DevOps, Jira)</li>
          <li>PR decoration with regulatory clause citations</li>
          <li>Auto-fix vulnerable dependencies</li>
          <li>Compliance evidence map</li>
          <li>Email support</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:hello@sentrik.dev?subject=Team%20License%20Request" class="btn btn-primary tier-cta">Contact Us</a>
      </div>

      <div class="tier-card featured">
        <div class="tier-badge">Most Popular</div>
        <div class="tier-header">
          <h3>Organization</h3>
          <div class="tier-price"><span class="price-amount">$99</span><span class="price-period">/mo</span><span class="price-seat">per seat</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">Full governance for compliance-driven organizations and regulated industries.</p>
        <ul class="tier-features">
          <li>Everything in Team, plus:</li>
          <li>22 standards packs (526 rules)</li>
          <li>MISRA-C, DO-178C, ISO 26262</li>
          <li>ISO 14971, IEC 81001-5-1, 21 CFR Part 11</li>
          <li>Governance profiles (strict / standard / permissive)</li>
          <li>AI agent identity &amp; session tracking</li>
          <li>Task/intent binding with scope enforcement</li>
          <li>Anomaly detection &amp; blast radius enforcement</li>
          <li>Signed compliance attestations</li>
          <li>Parallel scanning &amp; multi-agent scan mode</li>
          <li>Audit log with HMAC integrity signatures</li>
          <li>Priority email support</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:hello@sentrik.dev?subject=Organization%20License%20Request" class="btn btn-primary tier-cta">Contact Us</a>
      </div>

      <div class="tier-card">
        <div class="tier-header">
          <h3>Enterprise</h3>
          <div class="tier-price"><span class="price-amount">Custom</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="tier-desc">Full platform for large regulated teams with dedicated support and custom SLAs.</p>
        <ul class="tier-features">
          <li>Everything in Organization, plus:</li>
          <li>Human-in-the-loop approval workflows</li>
          <li>Auditor portal with time-boxed access tokens</li>
          <li>GRC integration (Drata, Vanta, Secureframe)</li>
          <li>C/C++ semantic analysis (clang-tidy / cppcheck)</li>
          <li>Custom rule pack authoring</li>
          <li>Seat management &amp; SSO</li>
          <li>AI harness compliance evidence reports</li>
          <li>Dedicated support &amp; implementation assistance</li>
          <li>Custom SLA</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="mailto:hello@sentrik.dev?subject=Enterprise%20Inquiry" class="btn btn-primary tier-cta">Contact Sales</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="pricing-faq">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Common questions</h2>
    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What&rsquo;s included in the free tier?</h3>
        <p>5 standards packs covering OWASP Top 10, SOC 2, Python Security, Go Security, and Supply Chain Security &mdash; 158 rules total. The VS Code extension, CLI, dashboard, MCP server, and CI/CD gate are all free. Free tier is permanent, not a trial.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>How do I access paid tiers during early access?</h3>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@sentrik.dev">hello@sentrik.dev</a> or contact us using the buttons above. We&rsquo;re onboarding teams manually during early access to ensure a quality experience.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Does it work with Cursor?</h3>
        <p>Yes. Cursor supports VS Code extensions directly &mdash; install the Sentrik extension from the VS Code Marketplace and it works in Cursor. The MCP server integration also works with Cursor&rsquo;s MCP support.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Can it run offline / in air-gapped environments?</h3>
        <p>Yes. License validation uses HMAC signatures with no phone-home requirement. All scanning runs locally. No cloud dependency for any core feature.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>What CI/CD systems are supported?</h3>
        <p>GitHub Actions (published to Actions Marketplace), Azure Pipelines, and GitLab CI are all supported. The CLI can run in any CI environment that supports npm or pip.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item">
        <h3>Do you support custom rules?</h3>
        <p>Yes &mdash; custom rule packs are available on the Organization and Enterprise tiers. Rules support regex, AST queries (25 languages via tree-sitter), file policies, and LLM-powered semantic checks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</ComingSoon>

<style>
  .pricing-hero { padding: 6rem 0 3rem; text-align: center; }
  .pricing-sub { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
  .pricing-sub a { color: var(--color-primary-light); text-decoration: none; }
  .pricing-sub a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .tiers { padding: 4rem 0 5rem; }
  .tier-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }

  .tier-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }
  .tier-card.featured { border-color: var(--color-primary); box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.2); }
  .tier-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: -12px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.25rem 1rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .tier-header { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .tier-header h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .price-amount { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; }
  .price-period { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 1rem; margin-left: 0.25rem; }
  .price-seat { display: block; color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.15rem; }

  .tier-desc { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

  .tier-features { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex: 1; padding: 0; }
  .tier-features li {
    padding: 0.4rem 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: var(--color-text);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .tier-features li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .tier-features li::before {
    content: "\2713";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--color-success);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .tier-features li:first-child { font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-primary-light); }
  .tier-features li:first-child::before { content: ""; }

  .tier-cta { text-align: center; width: 100%; }
  .tier-alt-cta {
    display: block;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tier-alt-cta:hover { color: var(--color-primary-light); text-decoration: underline; }

  .pricing-faq { padding: 5rem 0; }
  .pricing-faq h2 { font-size: 1.8rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; text-align: center; }
  .faq-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 1.5rem; }
  .faq-item {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }
  .faq-item h3 { font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .faq-item p { color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
  .faq-item a { color: var(--color-primary-light); text-decoration: none; }
  .faq-item a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) { .tier-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .tier-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .faq-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
